          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " (manipulate)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "rule"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "With much of New Thassilon located among the rugged heights of the Kodar Mountains, these elixirs have grown in popularity among those frequently travel the region. For 1 day, drinking this elixir while in mountainous terrain protects you from the effects of severe cold and grants you a +3 item bonus to Athletics checks made to Climb, "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "9b3d9121-5da3-57fe-a5d0-e0ff20210c41"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", or "
          },
          {
            "type": "ref",
            "id": "a76317a3-de3d-58c2-8b3e-5a73b09657be"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", as well as to saving throws against the effects of high altitude. The elixir also protects against extreme cold."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
